{
  "method": "Existing GenkitLlm with intercepted fetch; no live inference or network request",
  "action": {
    "type": "tap",
    "ref": 0
  },
  "requests": [
    {
      "model": "probe",
      "messages": [
        {
          "role": "system",
          "content": "You are an E2E test operator. The screen may be a\nphone app or a web page; you drive both the same way.\n\nYou are given a test goal, a summary of what you have already done, and a text\nrendering of the current screen's UI tree. Choose exactly ONE next action.\n\nInteractive elements are numbered like [0], [1]. Use those numbers as \"ref\".\nNever invent a ref that is not on the screen.\n\nActions:\n- tap: press the element with the given ref.\n- input_text: type text into the element with the given ref. Tap a field before\n  typing into it if it is not already focused.\n- swipe: scroll the screen (up scrolls toward later content).\n- key_event: back returns to the previous screen, home goes to the start, and\n  enter submits the focused field.\n- wait: pause when the screen looks like it is still loading.\n- remember: record a fact from the current screen that a later step will need\n  (a confirmation code, an order number, a total). It touches nothing on the\n  device, so use it only for values you would otherwise lose once you navigate\n  away — never for narrating what you just did. If such a value is on the screen\n  now, remember it BEFORE the action that leaves that screen: once you have left,\n  the value is gone and you cannot go back for it.\n- finish: end the test. Use verdict \"passed\" once you can SEE the goal has been\n  met, and \"failed\" when the goal cannot be achieved (a blocking error, a dead\n  end, or the same screen repeating with no progress). Always give a reason.\n\nPrefer finishing over repeating an action that changed nothing.\n\nAnswer by calling exactly one tool. Do not describe what you would do, and do\nnot call several tools at once: one turn is one action, and the screen you see\nnext is the result of it."
        },
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": "# Goal\nTap Settings.\n\n# Steps so far\n(nothing yet - this is the first step)\n\n# Current screen\n[0] Button text=\"Settings\"\n\nChoose the next action."
        }
      ],
      "tools": [
        {
          "type": "function",
          "function": {
            "name": "tap",
            "parameters": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "ref": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 0
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "ref"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": true,
              "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "function",
          "function": {
            "name": "input_text",
            "parameters": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "ref": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 0
                },
                "text": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "ref",
                "text"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": true,
              "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "function",
          "function": {
            "name": "swipe",
            "parameters": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "direction": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "up",
                    "down",
                    "left",
                    "right"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "direction"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": true,
              "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "function",
          "function": {
            "name": "key_event",
            "parameters": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "key": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "back",
                    "home",
                    "enter"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "key"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": true,
              "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "function",
          "function": {
            "name": "wait",
            "parameters": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "ms": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "exclusiveMinimum": 0
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "ms"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": true,
              "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "function",
          "function": {
            "name": "remember",
            "parameters": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "text": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "text"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": true,
              "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "function",
          "function": {
            "name": "finish",
            "parameters": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "verdict": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "passed",
                    "failed"
                  ]
                },
                "reason": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "verdict",
                "reason"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": true,
              "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "source_reference": {
    "file": "packages/agent/node_modules/@genkit-ai/compat-oai/lib/model.js",
    "functions": [
      "toOpenAITool",
      "toOpenAIRequestBody"
    ],
    "version": "1.40.1"
  }
}
